You can download the release models here following our [instructions](../README.md).

This directory should be organized as follows. 

```shell 
── checkpoints  # model checkpoints, need to download model checkpoints
  ├── SANet 
  │   ├── LEVIR
  │   │   ├── no_pretrain.pth
  │   │   └── with_pretrain.pth
  │   ├── LEVIR+
  │   │   ├── no_pretrain.pth
  │   │   └── with_pretrain.pth
  │   ├── S2Looking
  │   │   ├── no_pretrain.pth
  │   │   └── with_pretrain.pth
  │   ├── WHU
  │   │   ├── no_pretrain.pth
  │   │   └── with_pretrain.pth
  │   └── WHU_CUL
  │       ├── no_pretrain.pth
  │       └── with_pretrain.pth
  └── pre_train  # pre-trained models
      ├── Building
      │   └── pretrain_Building.pth
      └── Cultivalted land
          └── pretrain_cultivalted.pth
```

